      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "نبحث عن أصغر مضاعف مشترك للمقامات $6$ و $10$ و $15$ : إنّه $30$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{5}{6} = \\dfrac{5 \\times 5}{6 \\times 5} = \\dfrac{25}{30}$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{3}{10} = \\dfrac{3 \\times 3}{10 \\times 3} = \\dfrac{9}{30}$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{7}{15} = \\dfrac{7 \\times 2}{15 \\times 2} = \\dfrac{14}{30}$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{25 + 9 + 14}{30} = \\dfrac{48}{30} = \\dfrac{8}{5}$ (اختزلنا بالقاسم $6$) ."
        ],
        "result": "\\dfrac{8}{5}"
